  "packageHash": "6gX0LSpcEGgqzaQXbJrpSKQem1Jd3cl+yMjT5faj+KCKcKzuVaVgDPuNSTDToziEIji08fMa/01MnBWDznNfJw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 35753,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/gustavorviana/Viana.Results",
  "published": "2026-05-16T13:26:50.383Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING: serialized response shape changed. ListResult<T> is now emitted as a plain JSON array (was an object with \"data\"). Result<T> no longer emits the \"status\" or \"problem\" wrapper fields. PagedResult<T> keeps its metadata. Clients that depended on the wrapper shape must be updated.\n\t\t\tRemoved redundant Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Core PackageReference (already covered by Microsoft.AspNetCore.App FrameworkReference). This also removes the transitive Newtonsoft.Json 9.0.1 vulnerability (NU1903).",
